  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Gorilla Arm knuckles’ unique design allows them to be easily modified with a variety of useful capabilities.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Gorilla Arm/Mantis Blade Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> When installed, choose one of the following abilities to enhance the Gorilla Arm with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Electric:</strong> If damage dealt by the Gorilla Arm would reduce a target to under 1 HP, the user can choose to leave their target Unconscious at 1 HP instead.</li>\n<li><strong>Thermal:</strong> Whenever the Gorilla Arm ablates armor, it ablates 1 additional SP.</li>\n<li><strong>Toxic:</strong> The Gorilla Arm may be coated with Poison, Biotoxin, and Neurotoxin as if it was a Light Melee Weapon.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Gorilla Arm or Mantis Blade<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One item per ability, since the choice is fixed on install.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberarms).</em></p>"
